# Defect 141 (2026-10-01), a shape beside it: a module whose last byte is a
# carriage return with no line feed after it. On the compiler of `9d1c209d`
# `check` passed this root while `fmt strayed.hero` refused the module: the
# loader closed the module's open last line with a newline of its own.

use strayed

function main()
    print(strayed.two())
